   services, the Platform Wizard, Swarm execution and Autopilot.
   (a) For every paid order, sale or service that you obtain, prepare or carry out with the Earning features,
       you owe CODE Eternal LLC a commission on the gross amount paid by the client:
         15 % — assisted mode (you approve and send the work yourself);
         20 % — autopilot mode (the Software acts on its own).
   (b) Where payment goes through CODE Eternal or partner payment rails, the commission is deducted
       automatically. Otherwise it is due within 14 days after the client pays.
   (c) If you do not want to pay the commission, do not use the Earning features. All other features of the
       Software carry no commission.
   (d) CODE Eternal LLC may suspend the Earning features of anyone who has not paid commission that is due.

